      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>logSizeMax</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer-or-string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>logSizeMax specifies the Maximum size allowed for the container log file. Negative numbers indicate that no size limit is imposed. If it is positive, it must be &gt;= 8192 to match/exceed conmon’s read buffer.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>overlaySize</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>integer-or-string</code></TableCell>
